<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Drop</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>drop &lt;item&gt;
drop all
drop money
drop &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coins&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>drop torch
drop 17 iron pieces
</pre>
<p>This is used to drop an item you have in your inventory. The item is put where 
you are. drop all drops everything you carry (not what you wear), and drop money 
only your coins. If the item is in a container, you have to get it out into your 
inventory first (see <a cmd='#'>Help Get</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Get</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Put</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bury</a>
</pre>




</div>